{% include "components/site-header.njk" %}

<div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-12">
  <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold mb-6">Book CSV Schema</h1>

  <p class="text-lg mb-6">This page documents the CSV schema for the <a href="/cms/data/books.csv" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">/cms/data/books.csv</a> endpoint.</p>

  <section class="mb-8">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4">Overview</h2>
    <p class="mb-4">The CSV export contains 36 columns per record with comprehensive bibliographic, physical, and cataloging metadata.</p>

    <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-2">Column Structure</h3>
    <p class="mb-4">Key column groups include:</p>
    <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
      <li><strong>Bibliographic:</strong> title, author, ISBN, publisher, publication year</li>
      <li><strong>Physical:</strong> dimensions, page count, binding type, weight</li>
      <li><strong>Content:</strong> description, tags, classification</li>
      <li><strong>Collection:</strong> collection grouping, accession number, acquisition details</li>
      <li><strong>Media:</strong> image URL, cover image filename</li>
    </ul>

    <div class="bg-yellow-50 border-l-4 border-yellow-400 p-4 mt-6">
      <p class="text-sm"><strong>Note:</strong> The <code class="bg-gray-100 px-2 py-1 rounded-sm">price</code> field is intentionally left empty per library policy.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4">Related Documentation</h2>
    <p><a href="/api-documentation/" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">Return to API Documentation</a></p>
  </section>
